    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So, It's like low budget Hitman, but you're a bird</h2>A real bird of course. Because as we all know, Birds Are Real. <br>In this accurate bird simulation software will take you through some of the common everyday bird scenarios that our avian friends face throughout their lives. <br><br><strong>Bird simulation has never been so good</strong><br>We are Several Real People, and we have painstakingly replicated all the expected biological bird features. <br>Our bird simulation provides you with an in-depth understanding of the key components bird biology.<br>- The Bird thrusters. <br>- The Bird Shell(tm).<br>- The Built-in Harmonic frequency Vaporizer.<br>And of course that most endearing of bird qualities, the unladen desire to kill.<br><br><strong>You paid for the whole seat, but you're only gonna need the edge.</strong><br>Our birds travel the globe and beyond. <br>The fly around at the speed of sound. (That's not trademarked right?)<br>With our inbuilt speed-bird timer we challenge you to complete Birds Are Real in the fastest time possible.",
